---
description: Resolve the actual requested native recovery through model-owned semantic composition.
args:
  goal: string
returns: ContentArchiveFindings
---
Resolve the requested project recovery from the immutable reviewed edition and actual current working state. Let the goal, scoped evidence and approval determine which observations and semantic judgments are useful. Restore only when requested and natively admitted; the exact typed authority performs the version-preconditioned local batch. Preserve coeditor work and protected main, consume the actual application receipt, and reassess any changed-state feedback. Inspection-only requests need truthful findings without a write. An available archive or approval is not itself a request to restore.
